.nh
.TH "PB-RECIPE-LIST" "1" "Sep 2026" "Paperboat" "Paperboat CLI"

.SH NAME
pb-recipe-list - List the workspace's recipes


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpb recipe list [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
List the recipes of the active workspace (or --workspace) with their tags, how many
machines each has paired (of its max_machines), when its token expires and when it
was last used. Tokens are never shown again after create and rotate; the list prints
only their public id.

.PP
JSON output is supported with --json.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for list

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	print JSON


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--config\fP=""
	path to the CLI config file

.PP
\fB--no-customization\fP[=false]
	ignore local shortcuts, command defaults, and TUI preferences

.PP
\fB--server\fP=""
	paperboat-server base URL override

.PP
\fB--workspace\fP=""
	resource workspace selector: personal or a team slug


.SH EXAMPLE
.EX
  pb recipe list
  pb recipe list --json
.EE


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBpb-recipe(1)\fP
